            "value": "<p>Now 10-weeks old, the LaDoc La Vita litter is growing up fast. Every day is a new adventure and nothing beats getting to fully stretch their legs while tearing around the backyard. Great exercise and a learning experience every time. The new year is upon us and we're preparing ourselves for these beautiful souls to soon venture out to their new homes. If you are looking for a Scottish deerhound puppy, please <a href=\"mailto:Joyce@HoundRidge.net?subject=I&amp;apos;m%20interested%20in%20puppies\"><strong>contact Joyce Weaver<\/strong><\/a> about puppy availability.<\/p><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"1a6a9c75-6137-41b2-aab0-73278ad40762\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_large\" data-align=\"center\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"8b85f907-9e51-4371-ae89-2acee73f8d60\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_large\" data-align=\"center\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"292879e9-eeb4-47bb-953d-21bc804c6fc6\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_large\" data-align=\"center\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"fa31d27d-1666-48d6-b638-fcc1f3865de2\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_large\" data-align=\"center\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"85b00478-9690-494f-a622-7015fdc15f7c\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_large\" data-align=\"center\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"da8340c6-391d-4be3-a63a-60ddb819bf3a\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_large\" data-align=\"center\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media>",
